{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-04-04 07:30:00', 'title': 'MERIDIAN MICHIGAN ANNOUNCES APPOINTMENT OF NEW CHIEF MEDICAL OFFICER', 'text': 'DETROIT , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MERIDIAN MICHIGAN, A PROVIDER OF GOVERNMENT-SPONSORED HEALTH PLANS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS APPOINTED DR. KAY JUDGE AS ITS NEW CHIEF MEDICAL OFFICER, EFFECTIVE APRIL 10, 2022.\xa0 DR. JUDGE BRINGS OVER TWO DECADES OF EXPERIENCE FROM LARGE HEALTH SYSTEMS IN MICHIGAN AND CALIFORNIA.'}